  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『Ａ』の名を継いだ俺の元には\r\n今日も世界各国から、難事件が舞い込んでくる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『Ａ』が殺された事件から、不思議に繋がった縁──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "様々な能力を持つ探偵たち、\r\nそれに怪盗２８３にも助けられているが──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00225",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 2000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0457",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330010,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "お疲れ様です\r\nコーヒーいかがですか、『Ａ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "107",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "……ありがとう、はづきさん\r\nいただこうかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00681",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0326",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330020,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "先代の『Ａ』が亡くなった時は、\r\nどうなることかと思いましたけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "charType": "sub_characters",
    "charId": "staff",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330030,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "安心しました～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "はづきさんから見て、安心できる探偵ぶりなら\r\n及第点なのかな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330040,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "いい探偵ぶりだと思ってますよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "はは……褒められるのには慣れてないんです\r\n参ったな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "hazuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00682",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "……あ、そういえば",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330050,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "なんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "ひとつだけ、わからないことがあるんです\r\n桑山千雪は、なぜ『Ａ』の部屋を探し当てられたのか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "実は、その謎だけが解けていなくて……\r\nはづきさん、何かご存知ないですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330060,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ああ、それは……\r\nあぶり出しです♪",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330060"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330070,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "『Ａ』が送った招待状と、館の見取り図に\r\nあぶり出しを仕込んでおくよう言われていて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330070"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330080,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "ふたつを合わせると、謎解きが出てくるんです",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330080"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901032330090,
    "speaker": "はづき",
    "text": "それを解けば、\r\n『Ａ』の居場所がわかるようになってるんですよ～",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "voice": "special_communications/490103233/4901032330090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "『Ａ』",
    "text": "そんな仕掛けがあったのか……\r\n全然気がつかなかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 300,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
